# What the Vercel CLI leaves out of the upload (it does not read .gitignore).
# The page needs index.html, app.css, js/, assets/ and runs/. The rest is for
# building the site locally. web/check_site.py applies the same list.
*.py
__pycache__/
README.md
.gitignore
.vercel/
# web/api/ runs on Vercel; the CLI installs package.json there
!api/
!package.json
